{
  "title": "EventBridge · SAA-C03 개념 위키",
  "description": "이벤트 패턴에 따라 대상에 라우팅하는 이벤트 버스다.",
  "main": "<nav class=\"breadcrumb\" aria-label=\"현재 위치\"><a href=\"/concepts/\">개념 위키</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span><span>EventBridge</span></nav><div class=\"wiki-layout\"><aside class=\"wiki-toc\"><details open><summary>이 문서의 목차</summary><nav aria-label=\"문서 목차\"><ol><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/eventbridge/#overview\">개요</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/eventbridge/#custom-event-bus\">Custom Event Bus</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/eventbridge/#custom-event-bus-classic\">Custom Event Bus - Classic</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/eventbridge/#event-patterns-and-targets\">Event Patterns and Targets</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/eventbridge/#retries-dlqs-and-permissions\">Retries, DLQs and Permissions</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/eventbridge/#archive-and-replay\">Archive and Replay</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/eventbridge/#eventbridge-pipes\">EventBridge Pipes</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/eventbridge/#eventbridge-scheduler\">EventBridge Scheduler</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/eventbridge/#api-destinations-and-schema-registry\">API Destinations and Schema Registry</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/eventbridge/#scenario\">적용 예시</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/eventbridge/#references\">AWS 공식 문서</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/eventbridge/#practice\">연관 문제 5개</a></li></ol></nav></details><a class=\"back-index\" href=\"/concepts/\">← 전체 개념 보기</a></aside><div class=\"wiki-main\"><article class=\"term-article\"><header class=\"article-header\"><div class=\"term-meta\"><span>통합</span><span>25 / 62</span></div><h1>EventBridge</h1><p class=\"article-date\">공식 문서 확인 2026-09-30 · 8 subtopics</p></header><section id=\"overview\" class=\"overview\"><h2>개요</h2><p>EventBridge는 Event를 받아 Filter·Transform하여 Consumer로 전달하는 관리형 Event 연동 서비스다. AWS <span class=\"full-name\">(Amazon Web Services)</span> 서비스, 앱, 지원 SaaS의 Event를 느슨하게 연결할 때 사용한다.</p><p>현재 문서는 새로운 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/eventbridge/#custom-event-bus\">Custom Event Bus</a>와 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/eventbridge/#custom-event-bus-classic\">Custom Event Bus - Classic</a>을 구분한다. 기존 시험·자료의 Rule·Target 모델은 Classic 기준으로 이해하고, 최신 Bus의 보존·순서 기능까지 동일한 제약으로 묶지 않는다.</p></section><section class=\"visual\" aria-label=\"Routing과 Point-to-point\"><figure class=\"diagram\"><figcaption><b>Routing과 Point-to-point</b></figcaption><div class=\"diagram-body\"><div class=\"visual-lanes\"><div class=\"visual-lane\"><h3>Classic event bus</h3><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>AWS <span class=\"full-name\">(Amazon Web Services)</span> / App / SaaS Event</strong><small>Event Source</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node blue\"><strong>Rule + Event Pattern</strong><small>Filter·Transform</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>Targets</strong><small>지원 Consumer로 전달</small></div></div><div class=\"visual-lane\"><h3>EventBridge Pipes</h3><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>Single source</strong><small>Queue·Stream 등</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node blue\"><strong>Filter + Enrichment</strong><small>지원 처리 단계</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>Single target</strong><small>필요하면 Event Bus 연결</small></div></div></div><p class=\"diagram-note\">새 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/eventbridge/#custom-event-bus\">Custom Event Bus</a>의 Subscription·Retention 모델과 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/eventbridge/#eventbridge-scheduler\">Scheduler</a>는 본문에서 별도로 설명한다.</p></div></figure></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"custom-event-bus\"><h2>Custom Event Bus<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/eventbridge/#custom-event-bus\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/eventbridge/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>현재 모델은 Consumer가 Subscription을 만들고 설정한 기간의 Event 보존·Replay·Ordered Delivery·Non-JSON Payload를 지원한다. 신규 앱의 선택지로 공식 문서가 안내한다. Feature·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">Region</a>·과금 조건을 현재 문서에서 확인한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"custom-event-bus-classic\"><h2>Custom Event Bus - Classic<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/eventbridge/#custom-event-bus-classic\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/eventbridge/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>Bus Owner가 Rule과 Target을 정의하는 기존 모델이다. Default·Custom·Partner Bus와 Event Pattern으로 AWS <span class=\"full-name\">(Amazon Web Services)</span>·앱·SaaS Event를 전달한다. 기존 Classic 모델의 순서·보존 동작을 새 Custom Bus와 구분한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"event-patterns-and-targets\"><h2>Event Patterns and Targets<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/eventbridge/#event-patterns-and-targets\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/eventbridge/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>Classic Rule은 Source·Detail Type·Detail 값 등 Event 구조를 Match한다. 일치한 Event를 지원 Target으로 전달하며 Input Transformer로 Payload를 바꿀 수 있다. Rule은 임의의 장기 실행 Business Logic을 수행하는 Worker가 아니다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"retries-dlqs-and-permissions\"><h2>Retries, DLQs <span class=\"full-name\">(Dead-Letter Queues)</span> and Permissions<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/eventbridge/#retries-dlqs-and-permissions\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/eventbridge/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>Target 호출 권한·Resource Policy와 지원 Retry·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/#dead-letter-queues-and-redrive\">DLQ</a>를 설정한다. 전달 중복 가능성을 고려해 Consumer를 Idempotent하게 만든다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/#dead-letter-queues-and-redrive\">DLQ</a>를 만들기만 하고 EventBridge가 쓰는 권한을 빠뜨리면 실패 Event도 유실될 수 있다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"archive-and-replay\"><h2>Archive and Replay<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/eventbridge/#archive-and-replay\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/eventbridge/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>지원 Bus의 Event 보존·Archive에서 Event를 다시 처리할 수 있다. Replay가 기존 Side Effect를 다시 만들지 않도록 Consumer를 설계한다. Classic Archive와 새 Bus의 기본 Retention 모델은 조건이 다르다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"eventbridge-pipes\"><h2>EventBridge Pipes<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/eventbridge/#eventbridge-pipes\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/eventbridge/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>하나의 Source에서 하나의 Target으로 연결하는 Point-to-point 통합이다. Filter·Transform·Enrichment를 사이에 넣을 수 있다. 여러 Target <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sns/#fan-out-with-sqs\">Fan-out</a>이 필요하면 Pipe의 Target을 Bus로 연결하는 구성을 비교한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"eventbridge-scheduler\"><h2>EventBridge Scheduler<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/eventbridge/#eventbridge-scheduler\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/eventbridge/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>One-time, Rate, Cron Schedule로 지원 API <span class=\"full-name\">(Application Programming Interface)</span> 호출을 관리한다. Time Zone·Flexible Time Window·Retry·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/#dead-letter-queues-and-redrive\">DLQ</a>를 설정한다. 단순 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/\">SQS</a> Delay보다 긴 일정과 반복 실행을 관리하는 데 적합하다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"api-destinations-and-schema-registry\"><h2>API <span class=\"full-name\">(Application Programming Interface)</span> Destinations and Schema Registry<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/eventbridge/#api-destinations-and-schema-registry\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/eventbridge/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/eventbridge/#api-destinations-and-schema-registry\">API Destinations</a>는 지원 인증·연결 설정으로 HTTPS <span class=\"full-name\">(Hypertext Transfer Protocol Secure)</span> Endpoint를 호출한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/eventbridge/#api-destinations-and-schema-registry\">Schema Registry</a>·Discovery는 Event 구조를 공유하고 개발을 돕는다. 외부 API <span class=\"full-name\">(Application Programming Interface)</span>의 속도·Timeout·변경 관리가 별도로 필요하다.</p></section><section id=\"scenario\" class=\"scenario\"><h2>적용 예시</h2><p>SaaS 주문 Event를 Filter하여 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/step/\">Step Functions</a>로 보내고, <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dynamo/\">DynamoDB</a> Stream은 Pipe로 Bus에 연결한다. 매일 집계 실행은 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/eventbridge/#eventbridge-scheduler\">Scheduler</a>로 구성한다.</p></section><aside class=\"tip\"><b>시험에서 구별할 점</b><p>이벤트 규칙 라우팅과 큐 소비 모델을 구별한다.</p></aside><section id=\"references\" class=\"references\"><h2>AWS 공식 문서</h2><p>위 첨자는 아래 공식 문서로 연결됩니다. 서비스 제공 조건은 확인일 기준입니다.</p><ol><li id=\"reference-1\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/eventbridge/latest/userguide/eb-what-is.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">eventbridge/latest/userguide/eb-what-is.html ↗</a></li></ol></section></article><section id=\"practice\" class=\"related-questions\"><div class=\"section-heading\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">PRACTICE · ENGLISH</p><h2>연관 문제 5개</h2></div><a href=\"/concepts/quiz/q074/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q074\" data-question=\"Q074\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"3\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q074</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q074/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company wants to filter EC2 instance state-change events and send matching events to Lambda using a Classic event bus and rules. Which service provides this capability?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q074\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">An EBS snapshot</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q074\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">A network ACL</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q074\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">CloudFront caching</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q074\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon EventBridge</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 D</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/eventbridge/\">EventBridge</a> 규칙이 이벤트 패턴을 걸러 대상에 전달한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/eventbridge/\">EventBridge</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/lambda/\">Lambda</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q076\" data-question=\"Q076\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"0\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q076</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q076/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A workflow must explicitly handle branching, retries, and compensation across payment, inventory reservation, and shipment creation. Which service should be used?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q076\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS Step Functions</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q076\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon Route 53</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q076\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">EBS gp3</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q076\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">A network ACL</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 A</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/step/\">Step Functions</a>는 다단계 워크플로의 상태·분기·재시도를 관리한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/step/\">Step Functions</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/lambda/\">Lambda</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q073\" data-question=\"Q073\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"1\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q073</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q073/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">The same event must reach separate SQS queues for an email service and an analytics service. Which pattern is appropriate?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q073\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">A single EBS Multi-Attach volume</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q073\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Subscribe both SQS queues to an SNS topic</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q073\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Duplicate one ENI</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q073\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Connect two workers to a single SQS queue only</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 B</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sns/\">SNS</a>→여러 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/\">SQS</a> 큐가 각 소비자 그룹에 사본을 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sns/\">팬아웃</a>한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sns/\">SNS</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/\">SQS</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q092\" data-question=\"Q092\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"0,1\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q092</span><span class=\"type-label\">2개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q092/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An order event must be processed independently by several services. Which TWO components are central to the design?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q092\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">A separate SQS queue for each consumer service</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q092\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Publish the event to an SNS topic</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q092\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">All workers share the same ENI</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q092\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Move one EBS volume between AZs</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q092\" value=\"4\"><span class=\"option-letter\">E</span><span lang=\"en\">Remove every network ACL</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 A, B</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sns/\">SNS</a> <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sns/\">팬아웃</a>과 소비자별 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/\">SQS</a> 큐를 조합한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sns/\">SNS</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/\">SQS</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q077\" data-question=\"Q077\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"2\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q077</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q077/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A mobile application calls Lambda functions through an HTTPS API and needs authentication and request throttling. Which front-end service should it use?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q077\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS Transit Gateway</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q077\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon EBS</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q077\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon API Gateway</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q077\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">S3 Glacier</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/apigw/\">API Gateway</a>는 API <span class=\"full-name\">(Application Programming Interface)</span> <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/endpoint/\">엔드포인트</a>와 인증·제한 등을 제공한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/apigw/\">API Gateway</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/lambda/\">Lambda</a></div></article></section><nav class=\"sequence\" aria-label=\"용어 이동\"><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/eni/\">이전 용어 <b>ENI</b></a></span><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/fsx/\">다음 용어 <b>FSx</b></a></span></nav></div></div>"
}
